OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for memories from borough's
OL,4,A90-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhotographs and memories are being
OL,7,Fsought ahead of a borough's 90th
OL,8,Fanniversary celebrations in 2027.
OL,10,FEpsom & Ewell Borough Council has asked
OL,11,Fpeople to send in their stories to help
OL,12,Fmark nine decades since the local
OL,13,Fauthority was created in 1937.
OL,15,FContributions will "create a lasting
OL,16,Frecord of the borough's social
OL,17,Fhistory", according to the authority.
OL,19,FThe anniversary falls in the year the
OL,20,Fcouncil is set to be dissolved and
OL,21,Fmerged with neighbouring authorities to
OL,22,Fcreate the East Surrey Council.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
